 "scope": "Reproduce the authors' published GR toy example (datarail/gr_metrics) through the CLI.\n\nThe repository has no license, so its files are downloaded at validation time from\na pinned commit and checked by SHA-256; nothing is redistributed. Each of the 112\ncurves (cell line x agent x perturbation x replicate x time) is fitted by\n`agentic-prism analyze` and compared with OUTPUT/R_input1_GRmetrics.tsv (R GRmetrics).\nTolerances were set after the pre-freeze check recorded in the plan: observed\nmetrics (GRmax, GR_AOC) 1e-9 absolute; fitted parameters 2e-3 relative (independent\nbounded optimizers). The residual sum of squares at both parameter sets is reported.\n"
}
